# _headers — Cloudflare Pages header rules for the Web (PWA) deployment.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Applied to all routes (/brotherhood/*):
#   - Standard security headers for standalone PWA
#   - Allows framing from 'self' only (no Telegram embedding on web variant)

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

/*.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json; charset=utf-8

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/workbox-*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
